{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "tdkzq9cnap0m760p", "title": "Java高手进阶：基因算法与倒排索引在MySQL分库分表中的应用", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"UJzjA\" id=\"UJzjA\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua465c3ac\" id=\"ua465c3ac\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">场景描述</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u747217c6\" id=\"u747217c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5768aff8\" id=\"u5768aff8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">假设我们有一个大型电商平台，用户和订单数据量非常大，需要对数据库进行分库分表以提高性能。我们希望使用基因算法来找到最优的分库分表策略，从而提高查询效率和负载均衡。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"d3sn9\" id=\"d3sn9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc683327a\" id=\"uc683327a\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">基因算法（Genetic Algorithm, GA）</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua099c962\" id=\"ua099c962\"><span data-lake-id=\"u831d3a35\" id=\"u831d3a35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">基因算法是一种仿生优化算法，它基于自然选择和遗传学的原理，模拟生物进化过程来寻找最优解。基因算法特别适用于复杂的搜索空间和多峰值问题。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"scZXm\" id=\"scZXm\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab56b8c9\" id=\"uab56b8c9\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">基因算法应用步骤</span></h3><ol list=\"u47a71b75\"><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"uee8f4c58\" id=\"uee8f4c58\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaaff8273\" id=\"uaaff8273\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">个体表示</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6fda4a75\" id=\"u6fda4a75\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：每个个体表示一种分库分表方案。</span></li><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"u676f3e0e\" id=\"u676f3e0e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d46ff32\" id=\"u5d46ff32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">初始化种群</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue59ae4e1\" id=\"ue59ae4e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：随机生成若干个分库分表方案（个体）。</span></li><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"uf2e9cd08\" id=\"uf2e9cd08\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucc3c8257\" id=\"ucc3c8257\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">适应度评估</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u34ce4b90\" id=\"u34ce4b90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：计算每个个体的适应度，根据查询时间和负载均衡情况来评估。</span></li><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"u36fd5371\" id=\"u36fd5371\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub6c60230\" id=\"ub6c60230\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">选择</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c1a7127\" id=\"u2c1a7127\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：根据适应度选择个体，适应度高的个体更有可能被选择。</span></li><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"uad3475c1\" id=\"uad3475c1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8b5057c5\" id=\"u8b5057c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">交叉和变异</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udf632690\" id=\"udf632690\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：对选中的个体进行交叉和变异操作，生成新的个体。</span></li><li fid=\"u5197e968\" data-lake-id=\"u1232616f\" id=\"u1232616f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9cb5e032\" id=\"u9cb5e032\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold)\">迭代</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9d4ea627\" id=\"u9d4ea627\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">：重复上述步骤，直到找到最优解或达到迭代次数上限。</span></li></ol><h3 data-lake-id=\"pUos6\" id=\"pUos6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2f37ac0\" id=\"ua2f37ac0\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">基因算法在MySQL分库分表的案例</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"oTBeY\" id=\"oTBeY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3537b8d1\" id=\"u3537b8d1\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">1. 数据库架构</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uf918ce4b\" id=\"uf918ce4b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua935874d\" id=\"ua935874d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">假设我们有4个库，每个库中有3个订单表。每个表存储特定范围的订单数据。以下是初始的数据库架构：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%20orders_1%5CnCREATE%20DATABASE%20orders_1%3B%5CnUSE%20orders_1%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_1_1%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_1_2%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_1_3%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%20orders_2%5CnCREATE%20DATABASE%20orders_2%3B%5CnUSE%20orders_2%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_2_1%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_2_2%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_2_3%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%20orders_3%5CnCREATE%20DATABASE%20orders_3%3B%5CnUSE%20orders_3%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_3_1%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_3_2%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_3_3%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%20orders_4%5CnCREATE%20DATABASE%20orders_4%3B%5CnUSE%20orders_4%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_4_1%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_4_2%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders_4_3%20(order_id%20INT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%20user_id%20INT%2C%20amount%20DECIMAL(10%2C%202)%2C%20order_date%20DATE)%3B%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bW2mZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"G5v4W\" id=\"G5v4W\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud69ca54a\" id=\"ud69ca54a\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">2. 初始化种群</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ud7662c66\" id=\"ud7662c66\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud39d5211\" id=\"ud39d5211\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">随机生成初始种群，每个个体表示一种分库分表方案。这里我们使用SQL插入语句模拟种群初始化过程：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_1.orders_1_1%20VALUES%20(1%2C%20101%2C%20100.0%2C%20'2023-01-01')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_1.orders_1_2%20VALUES%20(2%2C%20102%2C%20200.0%2C%20'2023-01-02')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_1.orders_1_3%20VALUES%20(3%2C%20103%2C%20300.0%2C%20'2023-01-03')%3B%5Cn%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_2.orders_2_1%20VALUES%20(4%2C%20104%2C%20400.0%2C%20'2023-02-01')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_2.orders_2_2%20VALUES%20(5%2C%20105%2C%20500.0%2C%20'2023-02-02')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_2.orders_2_3%20VALUES%20(6%2C%20106%2C%20600.0%2C%20'2023-02-03')%3B%5Cn%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_3.orders_3_1%20VALUES%20(7%2C%20107%2C%20700.0%2C%20'2023-03-01')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_3.orders_3_2%20VALUES%20(8%2C%20108%2C%20800.0%2C%20'2023-03-02')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_3.orders_3_3%20VALUES%20(9%2C%20109%2C%20900.0%2C%20'2023-03-03')%3B%5Cn%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_4.orders_4_1%20VALUES%20(10%2C%20110%2C%201000.0%2C%20'2023-04-01')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_4.orders_4_2%20VALUES%20(11%2C%20111%2C%201100.0%2C%20'2023-04-02')%3B%5CnINSERT%20INTO%20orders_4.orders_4_3%20VALUES%20(12%2C%20112%2C%201200.0%2C%20'2023-04-03')%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wvSYX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"HADoj\" id=\"HADoj\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued7a248e\" id=\"ued7a248e\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">3. 适应度评估</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u8fa603cd\" id=\"u8fa603cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue98b14cc\" id=\"ue98b14cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13)\">计算每个个体的适应度，适应度可以根据查询时间和负载均衡情况来评估。这里，我们用一个简单的查询时间模拟：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%5CnSELECT%20COUNT(*)%20FROM%20orders_1.orders_1_1%20WHERE%20user_id%20BETWEEN%20100%20AND%20200%3B%5CnSELECT%20COUNT(*)%20FROM%20orders_2.orders_2_1%20WHERE%20user_id%20BETWEEN%20100%20AND%20200%3B%5CnSELECT%20COUNT(*)%20FROM%20orders_3.orders_3_1%20WHERE%20user_id%20BETWEEN%20100%20AND%20200%3B%5CnSELECT%20COUNT(*)%20FROM%20orders_4.orders_4_1%20WHERE%20user_id%20BETWEEN%20100%20AND%20200%3B%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E6%AF%AB%E7%A7%92%EF%BC%89%5Cn--%20orders_1.orders_1_1%3A%2050ms%5Cn--%20orders_2.